                <pb facs="0323" n="217" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg217"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr. McCreery</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-11-03"><hi rendition="#italic">November 3,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Give me all the facts you have and all the information you can get relative to
                    riot. Use naval cipher.</p>
            </div>
